Instructions for Using SocraticSieve with AI Assistants

The effectiveness of SocraticSieve depends on how you integrate it with your AI assistant. Here’s a breakdown based on the specific application you’re using:

Microsoft Copilot:

Go to Settings > Personalization.
Paste the text from SocraticSieve into the “Custom Instructions” field.
Click “Save Instructions.”

Other AI Applications:

Load the Large Language Model (LLM) you’re using.
Paste SocraticSieve's text as the first message in your prompt. This has been tested with multiple LLMs, but may not work well on smaller models.
